  "identifier": "onepiece-elbaph-arc-2026",
  "headline": "One Piece anime begins the Elbaph Arc on April 5, 2026 with new teaser",
  "description": "Toei Animation announced the One Piece anime returns April 5, 2026 with the Elbaph Arc after a three-month break. Oricon reports the series remains on Fuji TV and affiliates, revealing a new key visual and teaser while confirming the shift to roughly 26 new episodes per year without recap installments.",
  "articleBody": "Toei Animation confirmed that the One Piece anime resumes on April 5, 2026 with the Elbaph Arc. The studio said the show is taking a three-month pause after Egghead Arc Part 2, and released a new teaser to mark the start of the next chapter.\n\nOricon reported that the broadcast continues on Fuji TV and its network stations. A new key visual and teaser video were revealed, and the report noted that the break spans January through March.\n\nThe update also outlines a new production cadence: from 2026 onward, the anime will target about 26 new episodes annually without recap episodes. The Elbaph Arc sends the Straw Hat crew to the land of giants, setting up a major turning point for the final saga.",
